Content_Enlish:
Ten Minute School has published a notification for the recruitment of manpower. The organization has published a notification for the recruitment of 3 people for the post of 'Senior Teacher'. Interested candidates can apply online by December 31. In addition to the regular salary, the selected candidates will receive benefits according to the organization's policies. 

Organization Name: Ten Minute School; 

Post Name: Senior Teacher; 

Number of Posts: 3; 

Job Type: Full-time 

Other Benefits: 

* Weekly leave 2 days; 

* Lunch facility (partial subsidy); 

* Maternity-paternity leave; 

* Health Insurance; 

* Performance Bonus; 

* Annual salary increase; 

* Festival Bonus 2 times a year; 

* PTO; 

* TA Bill; 

* Mobile Bill; 

Candidate Type: Both men and women can apply; 

Age: Minimum 30 years; 

Workplace: Office; 

Workplace: Dhaka; 

Application Qualifications: 

*Must have a Master's degree; 

*Must have skills in management and educational technology; 

*Must have at least 2 years of experience; 

How to Apply: Interested candidates can apply by clicking here; 

Application Deadline: December 31, 2024; 

Click here to know more about the work area, application process and other details.
